                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Xi \vert \Gamma \; \mathrm{ctx}
            where
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Ξ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Xi
            is a list of crisp term judgments, and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Γ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma
            is a list of cohesive term judgments. A crisp type is a type in the context
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
